# DocAvail Environment Example
# Next.js prioritizes `.env.local` over `.env` during local development (`npm run dev` / `npm start`).
# Set local isolated PostgreSQL 18 credentials in `.env.local` so local testing NEVER writes to production Neon.

# Isolated Local PostgreSQL 18 (managed via `npm run db:local:up`)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:docavail_local@127.0.0.1:54322/docavail_local"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres:docavail_local@127.0.0.1:54322/docavail_local"

# Local JWT signing secret (replace with a strong random secret in production)
JWT_SECRET="replace-with-local-dev-jwt-secret"
